                                "sense_id": "6a54df17-33ce-3a9a-b5d2-0fd12d2f2605",
                                "text": "I recall vividly a bright summer morning, many years ago, when, in search of Caxtons, I entered the inner quadrangle of a certain wealthy College in one of our learned Universities."
